:[[Bujinkan Martial Arts]]: ancient, practical Japanese arts of self defense
:[http://www.frontsight.com/ Front Sight Firearms Training Institute]

<b>Firearms forums:</b>
:[http://www.packing.org/ Packing.org], a great resource for information on carrying concealed firearms
:[http://groups.yahoo.com/group/free-arms/ The Free Arms Project]: "...committed to the development of a patentless, Open Source, Open Engineering personal defense weapon."
:[http://www.thehighroad.org/ The High Road]: [[Oleg Volk]]'s very-active firearms discussion and trading site.

<b>General education (on rights and weapons):</b>
:[http://www.webleyweb.com/heap/ Ken Holder's [[H.E.A.P.]] Site]: "[[Holocaust Education and Prevention]]" resources
:[http://www.rkba.org/ [[RKBA]].org]: [[Jeff Chan]]'s [[Right to Keep and Bear Arms]] resources
:[http://www.jpfo.org/ Jews for the Preservation of Firearms Ownership]: "America's Most Aggressive Defender of Firearms Ownership"
:[http://www.ar15.com/ AR15.com]: incredible resource on the [[AR-15]] rifle and carbine

